OL,3,GNEWSAFinal 500-tonne load closes A47
OL,4,Aagain
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn abnormal load linked to the
OL,7,Fconstruction of an offshore wind farm
OL,8,Fwill make its way through Norfolk this
OL,9,Fweekend, causing a road closure.
OL,11,FThe 500-tonne load will close the A47
OL,12,Fon Sunday 06:30 GMT, as the last of
OL,13,Fnine transformers gets moved from the
OL,14,FPort of King's Lynn to the Orsted
OL,15,FOnshore Converter Station in
OL,16,FSwardeston, near Norwich.
OL,18,FThe load will be escorted by Norfolk
OL,19,FPolice and will travel at a maximum
OL,20,Fspeed of 10mph (16km/h ), which is why
OL,21,Fthe road is due to be closed most of
OL,22,Fthe day.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
