OL,3,GNEWSAFinal 500-tonne load closes A47
OL,4,Aagain
OL,5,
OL,6,FHornsea Three, located 74 miles (120km)
OL,7,Foff the Norfolk coast, will generate
OL,8,Fenough green electricity to power more
OL,9,Fthan three million homes. It is
OL,10,Fexpected to be the largest in the
OL,11,Fworld.
